# =============================================================================
# Documents
# Challenge synthetic CSVs and policy PDF in `documents/` are tracked in Git
# so the repository runs out-of-the-box. Temporary/raw scratch files are ignored.
# =============================================================================
documents/raw/
documents/*.tmp

